);box-shadow:0 2px 0 #016446,0 3px 8px rgba(1,135,95,.3)}\n.tl .tl-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #14a86f;outline-offset:2px}\n@media (max-width:560px){.tl .tl-btn{padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px!important}}\n/* nhãn thẻ PC trong footer: bản Anh dài hơn, giữ một dòng */\n.tl .nth-dl-pc .tl-en{white-space:nowrap;font-size:.8em}\n</style>\n<div class=\"tl-bar\"><div class=\"tl-sw\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Ngôn ngữ / Language\"><a class=\"tl-btn tl-set-vi\" href=\"#lang=vi\" role=\"button\">Tiếng Việt</a><a class=\"tl-btn tl-set-en\" href=\"#lang=en\" role=\"button\">English</a></div></div>\n<span class=\"tl-title-en\">THANK YOU, YOUNG HEROES, FOR TURNING 1 STAR INTO 5 STARS FOR XIAO HAN</span>\n<div class=\"tl-vi\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">Thú thật hôm nay đi làm Tiểu Hàn hơi uể oải, thế nhưng khi mở hòm review và đọc những lời ủng hộ từ mọi người, tự nhiên Tiểu Hàn thấy phấn chấn hẳn lên!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Gửi ngàn cái ôm và lời cảm ơn từ tận đáy lòng của tụi mình đến tất cả các Thiếu Hiệp. Giang hồ này sẽ chẳng nhộn nhịp đến thế nếu thiếu mọi người kề vai sát cánh. Dù đôi lúc tụi mình vẫn còn những thiếu sót khiến mọi người phiền lòng, nhưng chính sự kiên nhẫn và tình yêu thương của các Thiếu Hiệp đã tiếp thêm sức mạnh để Tiểu Hàn hoàn thiện hơn mỗi ngày. Cảm ơn mọi người rất rất nhiều!</p>\n<p><video width=\"400\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-clip.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" playsinline=\"playsinline\"></video></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-05.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-06.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-07.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-11-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-12-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<hr style=\"border:0;height:1px;margin:22px auto;max-width:70%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#8fd8c7,transparent);\">\n<style>\n  .download-group { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0; }\n  .download-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }\n  .download-group a { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 12px; transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease; }\n  .download-group img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; transition: transform 0.25s ease; }\n  .download-group a:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0px 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); }\n  .download-group a:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }\n  .btn-store { width: 300px; }\n  .btn-pc { width: 220px; }\n  @media (max-width: 640px){ .download-group { flex-direction: column; } .download-col { align-items: center; } }\n  .social-links { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .social-links a { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease; }\n  .social-links img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.25s ease; }\n  .social-links a:hover { transform: scale(1.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }\n  .social-links a:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }\n</style>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tl-en\" lang=\"en\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">Honestly, Xiao Han was feeling a bit sluggish at work today, but after opening the review box and reading everyone’s kind words of support, Xiao Han suddenly felt totally recharged!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Sending a thousand hugs and heartfelt thanks from all of us to every Young Hero. This martial world wouldn’t be half as lively without all of you by our side. Even though we still slip up sometimes and cause you trouble, it’s your patience and love that give Xiao Han the strength to get better every single day. Thank you all so, so much!</p>\n<p><video width=\"400\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto; max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-clip.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" playsinline=\"playsinline\"></video></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-596-cam-on-thieu-hiep-da-doi-1-sao/doi-5-sao-05.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" style=\"display: block; margin: 25px auto;\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn-mainsite-aka.vnggames.com/upload/nghichthuyhan/source/TinTuc/2026-10-5